cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this formalization, please cite it as below."
title: "A shape theorem for exploding sandpiles"
abstract: >-
  A machine-checked Lean 4 and mathlib formalization of the paper "A shape theorem for
  exploding sandpiles" (Bou-Rabee), in the corrected edition kept in paper/corrected-arxiv/.
  All 22 numbered results of the corrected edition and its Remark 1 are proved in Lean, with
  no `sorry` and only the standard axioms, from three cited results that enter as explicit
  hypotheses; Theorem 6.1 is stated as published, Theorems 1.2 and 1.3 as published with the
  law (2) read as one common law at every site, and Theorems 1.4 and 5.1 with the corrections
  listed in the corrected edition.
type: software
authors:
  - family-names: Bou-Rabee
    given-names: Ahmed
keywords:
  - Lean
  - mathlib
  - formal verification
  - Abelian sandpile
  - exploding sandpile
  - limit shape
  - probability
license: Apache-2.0
repository-code: "https://github.com/nitromannitol/Exploding-Sandpiles"
